  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IR-Ahwaz &amp; Shiraz Water Supply and Sanitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives are to:  (a)   enhance the quality of life in the proposed cities, Ahwaz and Shiraz, particularly in poor areas by: (i) improving access to satisfactory water supply and significantly increasing coverage of sanitation services; and (ii) improving environmental, hygiene and health conditions, as well as promoting reuse of treated effluents; (b)   strengthen and develop the capacity of Ahwaz and Shiraz Water and Wastewater Companies (WWCs), and assist the latter in improving their efficiency, sustainability and financial autonomy; and (c)   initiate sector reforms, particularly with respect to institutional arrangements, the regulatory framework, demand management, as well as prepare a sanitation strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
